      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.61,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "-: Now that we understood what the role of the star is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 8.85,
          "en": "we can write our own structural directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.85,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "So let's create a new directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "and I will use the CLI for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "I will name it unless, so I will basically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 20.4,
          "en": "create the opposite of the NGF directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.4,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "This directive here will attach something only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 24.75,
          "en": "if the condition is false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.75,
          "end": 27.033,
          "en": "NGF does it if the condition is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "So here I'll again delete the spec file here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 33.9,
          "en": "and in the unless directive I get my selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.9,
          "end": 35.61,
          "en": "which is fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 40.26,
          "en": "Now here I need to get the condition as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.26,
          "end": 42.21,
          "en": "So I'll add, add input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.21,
          "end": 44.82,
          "en": "And remember in the end we will use property binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.82,
          "end": 46.41,
          "en": "with the square brackets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.41,
          "end": 49.71,
          "en": "because Angular transforms it for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.71,
          "end": 54.71,
          "en": "We need to of course import input from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "And then here I want to bind to a property named",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 64.59,
          "en": "unless which kind of simplistic condition we get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 67.08,
          "en": "But whenever this condition changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.08,
          "end": 70.77,
          "en": "so whenever some input parameter here changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.77,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "I want to execute a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 76.89,
          "en": "and therefore I can implement a setter with the set keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 81.12,
          "en": "This now turns this into a method though technically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.12,
          "end": 83.13,
          "en": "and that's important to understand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 87.42,
          "en": "this still is a property, it's just a setter of the property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.42,
          "end": 89.7,
          "en": "which is a method which gets executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.7,
          "end": 93.12,
          "en": "whenever the property changes and it of course changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.12,
          "end": 96.09,
          "en": "whenever it changes outside of this directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.09,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "So whenever the condition we pass changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 100.68299999999999,
          "en": "or some parameter of this condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.61,
          "end": 105.99000000000001,
          "en": "Unless therefore needs to receive the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.99000000000001,
          "end": 109.22999999999999,
          "en": "the property would normally get as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.22999999999999,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "And we know that this will be a boolean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 112.95,
          "en": "because it will be our condition in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.95,
          "end": 115.263,
          "en": "So we could also name this, condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.25,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "Then we can check if the condition is not true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "which is the case in which I want to display something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 127.24,
          "en": "because unless is the opposite of NGF",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.1,
          "end": 129.36,
          "en": "and if the condition is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 131.253,
          "en": "well then I want to display nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.09,
          "end": 134.842,
          "en": "So that is how we get the condition, how we use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.842,
          "end": 137.013,
          "en": "how do we display something.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.09,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "Keep in mind that our UnlessDirective here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 146.84,
          "en": "in the end will sit on such a ng template component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.14,
          "end": 149.79,
          "en": "because that is what it gets transformed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.79,
          "end": 151.983,
          "en": "to by Angular if we use the star.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153,
          "end": 156,
          "en": "So we can get access to this template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156,
          "end": 157.32,
          "en": "and we also need to get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.32,
          "end": 160.5,
          "en": "to the place in the document where we want to render it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 162.183,
          "en": "Both can be injected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.23,
          "end": 168.23,
          "en": "The template can be injected by adding template ref",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.39,
          "end": 169.223,
          "en": "any name you like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.223,
          "end": 171.72,
          "en": "But the type is of type templateRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.72,
          "end": 174.32999999999998,
          "en": "So just like elementRef gave us access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.32999999999998,
          "end": 176.61,
          "en": "to the elemented directive was on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.61,
          "end": 178.89,
          "en": "templateRef does the same for a template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.89,
          "end": 180.21,
          "en": "and this is a generic type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.21,
          "end": 182.64,
          "en": "You can simply pass any here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.64,
          "end": 186.81,
          "en": "and we need to import templateRef from @angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.81,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "The second information piece we need is the view container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.84,
          "end": 191.85,
          "en": "So where should we render it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.85,
          "end": 195.54,
          "en": "The template is the what, now the question's where?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.54,
          "end": 199.71,
          "en": "So I'll name it a vcRef for ViewContainerReference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.71,
          "end": 202.65,
          "en": "And the type is ViewContainerReference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.65,
          "end": 204.42000000000002,
          "en": "or ViewContainerRef",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 207.45,
          "en": "which is also imported from @Angular/core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 207.45,
          "end": 211.5,
          "en": "That marks the place where we place this directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.5,
          "end": 212.67000000000002,
          "en": "in the document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.67000000000002,
          "end": 214.59,
          "en": "Angular marks this place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 214.59,
          "end": 215.423,
          "en": "And you can see this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 215.423,
          "end": 218.013,
          "en": "if you inspect it in the developer tools actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 218.85,
          "end": 221.73,
          "en": "So with these two tools available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 221.73,
          "end": 226.02,
          "en": "we can use the vcRef whenever the condition changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 226.02,
          "end": 229.17000000000002,
          "en": "to call the createEmbeddedView method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 229.17000000000002,
          "end": 231.45,
          "en": "which that's just what the name implies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 231.45,
          "end": 235.41,
          "en": "it creates a view in this view container.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 235.41,
          "end": 237.99,
          "en": "And the view simply is our templateRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 237.99,
          "end": 240.93,
          "en": "So this template we created there is exactly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 240.93,
          "end": 242.94,
          "en": "this reference to the template there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.94,
          "end": 245.25,
          "en": "is exactly what we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.25,
          "end": 248.19,
          "en": "Well, and if the condition is true in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 248.19,
          "end": 250.83,
          "en": "so if it's not what we are looking for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 250.83,
          "end": 254.82,
          "en": "then we'll simply call the clear method to remove everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 254.82,
          "end": 256.713,
          "en": "from this place in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 257.88,
          "end": 260.16,
          "en": "With that, our own directive is set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 260.16,
          "end": 262.77,
          "en": "Of course we need to make sure that it is added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 262.77,
          "end": 264.93,
          "en": "The CLI did this for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.93,
          "end": 268.33,
          "en": "And now in the app component we can use our own directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 269.37,
          "end": 274.37,
          "en": "maybe to replace NGF here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 274.44,
          "end": 277.9,
          "en": "So I'll comment out all this stuff here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 279.09000000000003,
          "end": 284.09000000000003,
          "en": "and only copy the original div down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.22,
          "end": 285.873,
          "en": "Comment this in of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 287.28,
          "end": 291.3,
          "en": "So here, instead of using ngf, I'll use appUnless",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.3,
          "end": 292.53,
          "en": "and the star is important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 292.53,
          "end": 295.14,
          "en": "because it still is a structural directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 295.14,
          "end": 297.6,
          "en": "otherwise we would have to manually write it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 297.6,
          "end": 298.86,
          "en": "with this ng-template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 298.86,
          "end": 300.303,
          "en": "Syntax you'll learn before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 301.38,
          "end": 303.09,
          "en": "So here of course we don't want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.09,
          "end": 305.97,
          "en": "if onlyOdd is false because keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 305.97,
          "end": 309.21,
          "en": "the unless directive will check for the opposite already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 309.21,
          "end": 312.27,
          "en": "So here we have to pass just onlyOdd.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 312.27,
          "end": 315.42,
          "en": "And with this in place we get that we can't bind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 315.42,
          "end": 318.69,
          "en": "to appUnless because it's not a known property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 318.69,
          "end": 319.983,
          "en": "Why do we get this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.36,
          "end": 322.89,
          "en": "Can be really hard to track.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.89,
          "end": 325.71,
          "en": "We get this error because what we are trying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.71,
          "end": 328.29,
          "en": "to do is we have property binding here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 328.29,
          "end": 330.48,
          "en": "custom property binding with @input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 330.48,
          "end": 333.39,
          "en": "and we're binding a property named unless.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 333.39,
          "end": 337.05,
          "en": "Now keep in mind the star automatically transforms this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 337.05,
          "end": 339.21,
          "en": "in this ng-template syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 339.21,
          "end": 342.42,
          "en": "where we then try to property bind to the directive name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 342.42,
          "end": 343.37,
          "en": "which is appUnless.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 344.49,
          "end": 347.64,
          "en": "So we have to make sure that our property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 347.64,
          "end": 350.55,
          "en": "shares the name of the directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 350.55,
          "end": 355.08,
          "en": "appUnless exactly the same, the same as the selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 355.08,
          "end": 357.733,
          "en": "Now with this, it works fine and as you can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 357.733,
          "end": 362.04,
          "en": "if I toggle here we get the same behavior as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 362.04,
          "end": 364.74,
          "en": "even though I commented out the NGF block",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 364.74,
          "end": 368.16,
          "en": "and use my own appUnless directive instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 368.16,
          "end": 371.733,
          "en": "So this is our own custom structural directive build.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
